{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 13 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">配准与投影几何：可微变换、拓扑约束和 SE(3) 闭环</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Registration &amp; SE(3)</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_124_lapirn-title\">LapIRN</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">LapIRN 把配准写成 Laplacian 金字塔上的三层残差流：每层先 warp，再让下一层只修正剩余误差。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Decomposes large-deformation 3D registration into a 3-level coarse-to-fine Laplacian image pyramid where each level warps the previous estimate and refines only the residual displacement.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">moving 体积 Im 与 fixed 体积 If</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D moving volume I_m and fixed volume I_f decomposed into a 3-level Gaussian/Laplacian pyramid</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">组合位移场、形变后的 moving 图像与可选 diffeomorphic 场</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Composed full-resolution deformation field (or stationary velocity diffeomorphism) and warped volume</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.16148\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_124_lapirn')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_124_lapirn')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"LapIRN original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/5887688e6a5abeadaa2d.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_124_lapirn', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_124_lapirn\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_124_lapirn')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_124_lapirn', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_124_lapirn\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Moving/fixed 图像金字塔</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Moving/fixed</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">建立低、中、高分辨率三层输入</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d moving volume i_m and fixed volume i_f decomposed into a 3-level gaussian/laplacian pyramid and prepares initial tensor representations (Moving/fixed).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"建立低、中、高分辨率三层输入\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d moving volume i_m and fixed volume i_f decomposed into a 3-level gaussian/laplacian pyramid and prepares initial tensor representations (Moving/fixed).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Moving/fixed 图像金字塔\" data-node-name-en=\"Moving/fixed\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_124_lapirn', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Moving/fixed 图像金字塔</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Moving/fixed</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">建立低、中、高分辨率三层输入</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d moving volume i_m and fixed volume i_f decomposed into a 3-level gaussian/laplacian pyramid and prepares initial tensor representations (Moving/fixed).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在最低分辨率预测大尺度位移 φ1\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Level 1 coarse network to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Level 1 coarse network\" data-node-name-en=\"Level 1 coarse network\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_124_lapirn', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Level 1 coarse network</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在最低分辨率预测大尺度位移 φ1</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Level 1 coarse network to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用上采样 φ1 先形变 moving，作为下一层初始化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Spatial transformer 1 within the core laplacian pyramid residual registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Spatial transformer 1\" data-node-name-en=\"Spatial transformer 1\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_124_lapirn', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Spatial transformer 1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用上采样 φ1 先形变 moving，作为下一层初始化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Spatial transformer 1 within the core laplacian pyramid residual registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"结合中尺度 fixed、已形变 moving 与粗场，预测残差 Δφ2\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Level 2 residual network within the core laplacian pyramid residual registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Level 2 residual network\" data-node-name-en=\"Level 2 residual network\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_124_lapirn', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Level 2 residual network</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">结合中尺度 fixed、已形变 moving 与粗场，预测残差 Δφ2</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Level 2 residual network within the core laplacian pyramid residual registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"组合粗场和中尺度残差后再次形变\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Spatial transformer 2 within the core laplacian pyramid residual registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Spatial transformer 2\" data-node-name-en=\"Spatial transformer 2\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_124_lapirn', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Spatial transformer 2</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">组合粗场和中尺度残差后再次形变</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Spatial transformer 2 within the core laplacian pyramid residual registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在全分辨率预测局部残差 Δφ3\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Level 3 refinement network within the core laplacian pyramid residual registration computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Level 3 refinement network\" data-node-name-en=\"Level 3 refinement network\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_124_lapirn', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Level 3 refinement network</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在全分辨率预测局部残差 Δφ3</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Level 3 refinement network within the core laplacian pyramid residual registration computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每层比较 warped moving 与 fixed，并约束位移梯度；diffeomorphic 版可积分速度场\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies unsupervised + regularization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"无监督相似度 + 平滑正则\" data-node-name-en=\"unsupervised + regularization\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_124_lapirn', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">无监督相似度 + 平滑正则</span><span class=\"lang-en\">unsupervised + regularization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每层比较 warped moving 与 fixed，并约束位移梯度；diffeomorphic 版可积分速度场</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies unsupervised + regularization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"φ1、Δφ2、Δφ3 逐级组合并输出配准图像\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces composed full-resolution deformation field (or stationary velocity diffeomorphism) and warped volume via Stage 08.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"最终组合形变\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_124_lapirn', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">最终组合形变</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">φ1、Δφ2、Δφ3 逐级组合并输出配准图像</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces composed full-resolution deformation field (or stationary velocity diffeomorphism) and warped volume via Stage 08.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"LapIRN Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 拉普拉斯金字塔中的逐级残差形变估计</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Multi-Resolution Laplacian Pyramid Residual Displacement Composition</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"LapIRN：核心公式 · 拉普拉斯金字塔中的逐级残差形变估计\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"124\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"17.865756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.52394 -69.00913 335.885515 17.865756\" width=\"335.885515pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.303975-4.441528C3.29673-4.709614 2.977925-4.912489 2.579419-4.912489C2.188159-4.912489 1.8766-4.760333 1.594023-4.427037C1.3